{
  "about": [
    "The book's design-of-experiments examples that Factorial opens by name: https://factori.al/?book=<name>.",
    "scripts/build_web_app.py makes each into book/<name>.json: the design as Plan makes it, its runs in the",
    "order of the book's table, each with the book's result. runs: one per row of the book's table, its settings",
    "in coded units (a label's low level -1, its high level +1) and the result last. order: the run order the",
    "book prints, where it prints one. blocks: the block (the day) of each run. note: shown when the example opens.",
    "tests/web/api/test_book_examples.py checks every coefficient the book prints against each of these."
  ],
